    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\n// The builder made the people search (roles, place, size, exclusions). Add the industry for the export only:\n// asking the builder for it starts a slow company-first crawl that writes account lists on your seat.\nconst INDUSTRIES = {\"Software Development\": 4, \"IT Services and IT Consulting\": 96, \"Financial Services\": 43, \"Staffing and Recruiting\": 104, \"Hospitals and Health Care\": 14, \"Advertising Services\": 80, \"Technology, Information and Internet\": 6};\nconst form = $('Describe your leads').first().json;\nconst r = $json.structuredContent.result;\nlet url = r.url;\nif (!url) throw new Error('Evaboot returned no search URL: ' + JSON.stringify(r).slice(0, 300));\nif (r.strategy && r.strategy !== 'leads') throw new Error(`Evaboot built a ${r.strategy} search, not a people search. Describe only roles and place in the sentence.`);\nconst ind = INDUSTRIES[form['Industry']];\nif (ind) {\n  if (!/\\)\\)$/.test(url)) throw new Error('Unexpected search URL shape, industry not added: ' + url.slice(-80));\n  url = url.replace(/\\)\\)$/, `%2C(type%3AINDUSTRY%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3A${ind}%2CselectionType%3AINCLUDED)))))`);\n}\nreturn [{ json: { url, total: r.result_count || 0, reply: r.reply || '' } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "7a965140-c537-47ef-8765-5b67dc93eda0",
      "name": "Add the industry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "text": "={{ $json.reply }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You judge a Sales Navigator preview against what the user wants. The message is the search builder's reply: it holds a table of sample people with their title and company. Take every person in the table, and for each one return {title, company, fit: true or false, reason}, judging from the title and company only. A lead fits when its title matches the roles and seniority the user described and nothing in the title or company name contradicts the rest. Mark consultants, advisors, fractional and independent roles as not a fit. The reason is 2 to 6 words, the same wording for the same kind of miss. Never guess facts you cannot see.\n\nWhat the user wants:\n{{ $('Describe your leads').first().json['Who (roles, seniority, country)'] }}, company size {{ ($('Describe your leads').first().json['Company size'] || []).join(', ') || 'any' }}, industry {{ $('Describe your leads').first().json['Industry'] }}.",
          "maxIterations": 3
        }
      },
      "id": "06c495b6-e546-4808-b86a-ddf1ede6a23e",
      "name": "Judge the preview",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1560,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
